<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-052" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete" source-id="s-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028:m0000" ref="roi_rz4_ute">昭</persName>弟子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028:m0003" ref="12c_0ik_qok">奮</persName>年二十，造作攻城大攻車，爲<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028:m0017" ref="snv_2iq_jes">歩騭</persName>所薦。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028:m0022" ref="roi_rz4_ute">昭</persName>不願曰：&quot;妝年尚少，何爲自委於軍旅乎?&quot;<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028:m0043" ref="12c_0ik_qok">奮</persName>對曰：&quot;昔<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028:m0049" ref="47q_gyf_zia">童汪</persName>死難，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028:m0054" ref="q57_4y3_6fu">子奇</persName>治阿，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-052-zhangfen-complete:line028:m0059" ref="12c_0ik_qok">奮</persName>實不才耳，於年不爲少也。&quot;遂領兵爲將軍，連有功效，至（平州）都督，封樂鄕亭侯。</p>
</text>
